<title>SRI LANKA: Merchant Bank 1996 net sharply up.</title>
<headline>Merchant Bank 1996 net sharply up.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Merchant Bank of Sri Lanka Ltd, for the financial year ended 31 December, 1996.  (in millions of rupees unless stated);</p>
<p>		    31.12. 1996		31.12.1995</p>
<p>    Income	 1,134.69	vs	  878.57</p>
<p>    Net profit	54.93	vs	   33.79</p>
<p>    Tax		 13.13	vs	   14.91</p>
<p>NOTE - Merchant Bank is a subsidiary of the state-owned Bank of Ceylon. The company consolidates accounts with MB Financial Services Ltd, Lanka Securities (Pvt) Ltd, Merchant Credit Ltd and Nepal Merchant Bank Ltd.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
